Subject: [M156] HttpCache: prevent lock timeout overtaking explicit restart

Original change's description:
> HttpCache: prevent lock timeout overtaking explicit restart
>
> ...by cancelling it when queuing the restart. This can happen if our
> thread is super-overloaded (which is worrisome)
